---
import '@fontsource/instrument-serif/400.css';
import '@fontsource/instrument-serif/400-italic.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-sans/400.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-sans/500.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-sans/600.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/400.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/500.css';
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import PodExplorer from '../../../components/coffee/PodExplorer.svelte';

const title = 'Nespresso Pod Explorer: Original and Vertuo Capsules by Cup Size and Intensity';
const description = 'Pick your machine and see Nespresso’s US Original or Vertuo capsules, carafe sizes aside, laid out by cup size and intensity. Open one for its roast, aroma notes and the cup it pours.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
			'@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'WebApplication', name: 'Nespresso Pod Explorer', url: 'https://jayarr.coffee/tools/nespresso-pods/', description,
			applicationCategory: 'UtilityApplication', operatingSystem: 'Any', offers: { '@type': 'Offer', price: '0', priceCurrency: 'USD' }, publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'JayArr Coffee', url: 'https://jayarr.coffee' },
		})}></script>
	</head>
	<body class="cf-page">
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="cf-intro">
				<a href="/tools/" class="cf-back">← All tools</a>
				<p class="cf-kicker">Nespresso Pod Explorer</p>
				<h1>Your machine's capsules, <em>on one wall</em></h1>
				<p class="cf-lede">Choose Original or Vertuo. Each capsule sits on a wall by the cup it makes and how intense Nespresso rates it; pick one to see its roast, its aroma notes and the cup it pours.</p>
			</section>
			<section class="cf-tool" aria-label="Nespresso Pod Explorer"><PodExplorer client:load /><noscript><p class="tool-noscript">The capsule wall needs JavaScript. The notes below explain Original and Vertuo, intensity and cup sizes.</p></noscript></section>

			<article class="cf-body">
				<h2>Original or Vertuo?</h2>
				<p>The two systems don't share capsules. <strong>Original</strong> machines push water through a small, flat-topped capsule with a pump, the way an espresso machine does, and make espresso, ristretto and lungo. <strong>Vertuo</strong> machines read a barcode on the rim of a dome-shaped capsule and spin it while brewing, which is how one machine makes everything from an espresso to a large mug. If you're not sure which you have, look at a used capsule: a flat top is Original, a dome is Vertuo.</p>

				<h2>What the intensity number means</h2>
				<p>Nespresso's intensity scale runs from 1 to 13. It describes roast darkness, body and bitterness, not caffeine: an 11 tastes darker and heavier than a 5, but it isn't "stronger" in caffeine. Caffeine depends mostly on how much coffee is in the capsule and on the beans; robusta has roughly twice the caffeine of arabica by weight, so capsules blended with robusta usually carry more. Some milk-recipe capsules have no intensity rating at all; they sit in the wall's <em>n/r</em> column.</p>

				<h2>Choosing by cup size</h2>
				<p>Each Vertuo capsule is made for a size of drink, from a 25 ml ristretto to the 355 ml Alto and Cold Brew Style capsules (carafe capsules aren't listed here), so the size you want comes first. The 355 ml XL capsules need a newer Vertuo machine: Nespresso lists the Creatista, Lattissima, Next, Pop and Up, not the original Vertuo, Evoluo or VertuoPlus. Original capsules make ristretto (25 ml), espresso (40 ml) or lungo (110 ml), and a few, such as the flavored Barista Creations, are made for a lungo. A lungo capsule is blended and ground for the longer drink, so it isn't simply an espresso capsule run longer. The cups drawn in the explorer share one width, so their heights compare volumes directly.</p>

				<h2>Tasting several side by side</h2>
				<p>The quickest way to find a favorite is to taste two or three at once. Add capsules to a flight, brew them into the same kind of cup one after another, and taste from mildest to most intense. If you drink milk drinks, taste them with milk too: the Barista Creations range is blended for milk, and several of its capsules have no intensity rating.</p>

				<h2>Related guides</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/blog/what-is-nespresso-and-which-is-the-best/">What is Nespresso, and which is the best?</a></li>
					<li><a href="/blog/whats-different-about-ristretto-or-lungo-espresso-shots/">Ristretto vs lungo</a></li>
					<li><a href="/blog/espresso-vs-drip-coffee/">Espresso vs drip coffee</a></li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Sources</h2>
				<ul class="cf-sources">
					<li>Nespresso, the US Original and Vertuo catalogues and product pages (range, cup sizes, intensities, aroma notes, roast filters and roastiness), checked October 15, 2026. Each capsule links to the Nespresso page its details came from, usually its own product page.</li>
				</ul>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>.cf-page { background: #f3ede3; }</style>
<style>
	main { color: #2a1d15; }
	.cf-intro { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px 22px; }
	.cf-back { font: 500 12px/1 'IBM Plex Mono', 'IBM Plex Mono Metrics', monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #75655a; text-decoration: none; }
	.cf-kicker { font: 500 12px/1 'IBM Plex Mono', 'IBM Plex Mono Metrics', monospace; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8f5d22; margin: 26px 0 0; }
	h1 { font: 400 clamp(40px, 6vw, 68px)/.98 'Instrument Serif', 'Instrument Serif Metrics', Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin: 10px 0 12px; }
	h1 em { font-style: italic; color: #7a4e30; }
	.cf-lede { font: 400 17px/1.5 'IBM Plex Sans', 'IBM Plex Sans Metrics', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #5b4a3d; max-width: 37.2em; /* 62ch of Plex */ margin: 0; }
	.cf-tool { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 24px 40px; }
	.cf-body { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 24px 72px; font: 400 17px/1.7 'IBM Plex Sans', 'IBM Plex Sans Metrics', system-ui, sans-serif; }
	.cf-body h2 { font: 400 34px/1.1 'Instrument Serif', 'Instrument Serif Metrics', Georgia, serif; margin: 44px 0 12px; }
	.cf-body a { color: #7a4e30; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
	.cf-sources { font-size: 14.5px; color: #5b4a3d; }
	@media (max-width: 640px) { .cf-intro { padding: 96px 16px 18px; } .cf-tool { padding: 4px 12px 32px; } .cf-body { padding: 16px 16px 56px; } }
</style>
